sdc4:mc-ve8kic9l1ea0p9lcdn0e0n9t-shape a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:label "Encounter: planned entered in error states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the planned entered in error path of the Encounter workflow, in order: planned, entered-in-error. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The FHIR Encounter lifecycle: planned, arrived, triaged, in progress, on leave, finished, cancelled." ;
